 with a Japanese-style toilet.<br />\r\n- A character in gym clothes. She wants to go to the toilet before physical education class to get rid of the source of her weight.<br />\r\n- A character in a gym uniform. She can't poop, so she uses a certain item.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01683000/RJ01682191/576b2053d62c0c2ebc0b4a4298442ce1.jpg", "alt": "覗き忍・戻 キャラ追加版 [MuMu-Factory]", "title": "覗き忍・戻 キャラ追加版 [MuMu-Factory]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "適用方法(How to apply)", "body": [{"intro": "詳しくは、同梱の「DLC適用方法.txt」または「DLC適用方法.png」をご覧ください。<br />\r\nFor more details, please refer to the included \"DLC適用方法.txt\" or \"DLC適用方法.png\" files."}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "ご注意(Note)", "body": [{"intro": "・本体となる「覗き忍・戻(RJ01595947) 」バージョン1.6以降が必要になります。<br />\r\n・覗き忍・戻(RJ01595947)の最新版へのバージョンアップをお願い致します。<br />\r\n・本作品はバグ対応などによるバージョンアップをする可能性があります。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The main application, \"Peeping Ninja Returns(RJ01595947)\" version 1.6 or later, is required.<br />\r\n- Please update to the latest version of \"Peeping Ninja Returns(RJ01595947)\".<br />\r\n- This game may be updated with new versions to fix bugs and other issues."}]}], "description": "本作品は、「覗き忍・戻(RJ01595947)」用のキャラクター追加コンテンツです", "short_introduction": "本作品は、「覗き忍・戻(RJ01595947)」用のキャラクター追加コンテンツです", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01682191.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794942622}